<p>Hello,</p>
<p>This is a reminder that your video call will start in about 15 minutes.</p>
<ul>
  <li>When: <%= @scheduled_time.in_time_zone(@scheduled.scheduled_tz || Time.zone.name).strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M %Z') %></li>
  <% if @join_url.present? %>
  <li>Join link: <a href="<%= @join_url %>"><%= @join_url %></a></li>
  <% else %>
  <li>Join: Open your chat window now to join the call.</li>
  <% end %>
</ul>
<p>See you soon.</p>